    {
      "id": "claim_121e190a710b483e9bc413864144026d",
      "statement": "`streamCompletion` is the single entry point to a provider: it installs the local Origin rule, streams via the AI SDK `streamText`, reports accumulated text through `onText` after every delta, and re-throws an error captured by `onError` after the stream loop ends.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/llm.ts#L42-L62",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:38e41f7465a040a8db1f45e20873f4a5d36a5ea0d9e723d4961827ee583df649:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3f53ae9379c14869880186990c850356",
      "statement": "The repair turn in `lib/generate.ts` reuses `streamCompletion` but discards its streamed text, because the repair output is a patch while the UI keeps showing the first attempt.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/generate.ts#L44-L92",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c2a86713c9dc4b6db4e615095a40edf3fb125bef3eda2a6212a6197226da0a00:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8d4e9e9ed7a34ff290f4929af0077306",
      "statement": "`describeError` maps an AbortError to \"stopped\", 401 to a rejected key, 403 to access denied, 404 to not found, 429 to rate limited, and network-style messages to a connectivity hint, falling back to the raw error message.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/llm.ts#L64-L79",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:483279a78ddcd3f4284f4c0ca00ecd54a32b954a411e2ca25110f2dec3d9ce24:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e349019123cd43b69df612913491b217",
      "statement": "An HTTP 403 against a local provider produces a different message (\"the local server refused the request\") than a 403 against a hosted provider (\"access denied\"), because the local case is determined by the active provider's resolved base URL.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/llm.ts#L64-L79",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:483279a78ddcd3f4284f4c0ca00ecd54a32b954a411e2ca25110f2dec3d9ce24:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://locales/en/errors.json#L11-L19",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ec075316e071f10188f149f40d4ce3f4181ce69894b7e97e9cc364bc87b839ee:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4a503170ff234a70851279d5e390e5c1",
      "statement": "Local servers such as Ollama reject requests whose `Origin` is `chrome-extension://…` with HTTP 403 unless `OLLAMA_ORIGINS` is set; Chrome omits `Origin` on simple GETs but always sends it on POST, so listing models can work while generation fails.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/local-origin.ts#L25-L32",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:dc47e9e5cb3cec416fbaff74580b44ad8ccc33acf3bc20f598047a2eb67ca45f:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_43831f5528814751a15a427f475abed8",
      "statement": "The Origin rewrite is a declarativeNetRequest session rule that sets the `origin` request header to the server's own origin, and it only matches requests initiated by this extension via `initiatorDomains: [browser.runtime.id]`, so web pages cannot use it to bypass the local server's origin protection.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/local-origin.ts#L34-L55",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0b30d322d55bece1622443a30b37201a245ce0f199964663c2a040dd9236933b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_bc171ac86d9548bbb7983f39011196a8",
      "statement": "The local-origin rule is session-scoped, uses a stable hash-derived rule id per origin that is removed before being re-added, and is applied at most once per origin per page lifetime; it is installed only for `localhost`, `127.0.0.1`, `0.0.0.0` and `[::1]`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/local-origin.ts#L1-L22",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d6cf5b18fba7bcb62bdba920596ea5061d92ba9956869edddac2aa984b577262:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/local-origin.ts#L34-L55",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0b30d322d55bece1622443a30b37201a245ce0f199964663c2a040dd9236933b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_61e9028cb42c44b8acf83ea800f4c656",
      "statement": "`allowLocalOrigin` is invoked both before a provider request in `streamCompletion` and before a model-list request in `fetchModels`.",
      "evidence": [
