      "id": "claim_db388f67556a4ea7ae64be3ddb94bee7",
      "statement": "The Gemini model list is filtered to models whose `supportedGenerationMethods` include `generateContent` and the `models/` prefix is stripped from the id; the OpenAI-compatible response is accepted as a bare array or as an object with `data` or `models`.",
