    {
      "id": "claim_e08234e90b134366baefd8d70b36672c",
      "statement": "Ollama lists models that cannot chat, so `keepOllamaChatModels` posts to the native `/api/show` endpoint (base URL with a trailing `/v1` removed) and keeps only models reporting the `completion` capability, treating an unknown capability or a failed request as \"keep\".",
