      "id": "claim_97b7b740dbaa465fae9a08ff4abe285e",
      "statement": "A provider counts as connected when it has a saved API key, or — for keyless providers — when it has a chosen model or a non-empty cached model list; the active provider is always listed in the switcher even when not fully set up.",
