      "id": "claim_dd9ec790444243178ae207546519a571",
      "statement": "The settings form reloads the model list automatically 600 ms after the API key or base URL changes, and the explicit Load models button requests the host permission synchronously inside the click handler before loading, because Chrome drops the user gesture if an await happens first.",
